+   "instructions": "Run your VIN at nhtsa.gov/recalls. 2014 bikes are in recall 15V441 (fuel tank inserts can leak). 2015-2018 bikes are in recall 18V033 (front brake master cylinder piston can crack). 2020 bikes are in recall 21V122 and 2020-2022 bikes in recall 22V900 (wiring harness can short).",
